 library on Fridays. 7. The big bargain packs. 8. Things she could borrow from a neighbor. And 9. Anything that wanted money every month. Now tell me in the comments, which one of these nine did you stop buying already? And which one will you stop this month? I read everyone with a cup of barley tea.", "words": [{"w": " I", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.14}, {"w": " wrapped", "s": 0.14, "e": 0.46}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.46, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " own", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.06}, {"w": " granddaughter's", "s": 1.06, "e": 1.74}, {"w": " birthday", "s": 1.74, "e": 2.18}, {"w": " present", "s": 2.18, "e": 2.62}, {"w": " in", "s": 2.62, "e": 2.88}, {"w": " it", "s": 2.88, "e": 3.02}, {"w": " last", "s": 3.02, "e": 3.32}, {"w": " spring,", "s": 3.32, "e": 4.2}, {"w": " a", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.28}, {"w": " jar", "s": 4.28, "e": 4.62}, {"w": " of", "s": 4.62, "e": 4.82}, {"w": " my", "s": 4.82, "e": 4.98}, {"w": " plum", "s": 4.98, "e": 5.28}, {"w": " jam,", "s": 5.28, "e": 6.04}, {"w": " and", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.14}, {"w": " she", "s": 6.14, "e": 6.28}, {"w": " gave", "s": 6.28, "e": 6.58}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.58, "e": 6.78}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 6.78, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " back", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.38}, {"w": " to", "s": 7.38, "e": 7.52}, {"w": " me", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.72}, {"w": " with", "s": 7.72, "e": 8.12}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.12, "e": 8.26}, {"w": " little", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.5}, {"w": " note", "s": 8.5, "e": 8.8}, {"w": " inside.", "s": 8.8, "e": 9.86}, {"w": " The", "s": 9.86, "e": 9.98}, {"w": " same", "s": 9.98, "e": 10.34}, {"w": " blue", "s": 10.34, "e": 10.62}, {"w": " cloth,", "s": 10.62, "e": 11.36}, {"w": " three", "s": 11.36, "e": 11.54}, {"w": " generations", "s": 11.54, "e": 12.34}, {"w": " now.", "s": 12.34, "e": 13.2}, {"w": " So,", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.72}, {"w": " the", "s": 13.72, "e": 13.86}, {"w": " nine", "s": 13.86, "e": 14.14}, {"w": " things", "s": 14.14, "e": 14.5}, {"w": " my", "s": 14.5, "e": 14.72}, {"w": " mother", "s": 14.72, "e": 15.0}, {"w": " stopped", "s": 15.0, "e